OL,3,GNEWSATwo boys in court over Halloween
OL,4,Aparty stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boy charged with attempted murder
OL,7,Fwas remanded in custody to appear at
OL,8,FSouthampton Crown Court on 13 November,
OL,9,Fwhile the other indicated a not guilty
OL,10,Fplea and will return later for a
OL,11,Fdecision on which court hears his case.
